      "default_value": "Values behind these products are design targets from the 2026 lab testing results, confirmed by industrial scale pilot results by the end of 2027. Silica with controlled total accessible surface area is our key target, provable by summer 2028, with three fallback grade types available. Agricultural silicon dioxide is tested by field trials from December 2027. Pigment grade iron is to be validated, with iron ore concentrate as the fallback. Sheets move from “Target specification” to “Typical analysis” one at a time, each with a revision.",
